iterations.reply:
I left out the metadata enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and it still grants only `LLMClient<inference>`. Importing `http-client` would widen that authority, so the grant and the node declaration need updating first. The fetch would also send untrusted feed text into an outbound URL. Once the `with` clause includes `HTTPClient` scoped to `metadata.internal.example`, I can add it with the text percent-encoded.

